@669bdl,

Thank you again for fostering such an enlightening discussion. It brings forth the significance of examining diverse viewpoints, lending depth to what might initially appear simple; indeed, it elevates us collectively toward a greater awareness of the intricate landscape of human health.

Engaging with the concept of fasting, especially how it intertwines with personalized nutrition strategies supported by science—as opposed to solely relying on biblical interpretations—it invites reflection upon whether cultural understandings inherently serve every individual's best interests or if universal

